@startuml
' DOC-3.3-SEQ4 | v0.3 | 日期: 2026-06-06 | 状态: 终审修正
' 文档ID: DOC-3.3 | 文件: judge-review-flow.seq.puml
' 依赖: architecture.md §5, class-diagram.puml v0.5, PRD §9, US-J01/J02
' 覆盖: 文档提交 → 硬约束逐项检查 → 退回/通过 → 代码提交 → PlantUML一致性校验 → GWT覆盖检查 → 综合判定
' 参与者: GuideAgent, CodingAgent, JudgeAgent, HardConstraintChecker, SoftConstraintEvaluator, ProjectDocumentSystem

participant GuideAgent
participant CodingAgent
participant JudgeAgent
participant HardConstraintChecker
participant SoftConstraintEvaluator
participant ProjectDocumentSystem

== 第一道关: 文档体系审查 ==

GuideAgent -> ProjectDocumentSystem : 触发文档审查
activate ProjectDocumentSystem
ProjectDocumentSystem -> JudgeAgent : 提交审查(project-root)
deactivate ProjectDocumentSystem
activate JudgeAgent

JudgeAgent -> HardConstraintChecker : executeHardCheck(project-root)
activate HardConstraintChecker

Note over HardConstraintChecker : 硬约束逐项检查(不可通融)

HardConstraintChecker -> ProjectDocumentSystem : 读取01_PRD/prd.md
activate ProjectDocumentSystem
HardConstraintChecker -> HardConstraintChecker : checkPRDCompleteness(prd)
Note over HardConstraintChecker : ✓ 项目名称?\n✓ 目标用户?\n✓ 核心功能列表?\n✓ 验收标准?

HardConstraintChecker -> HardConstraintChecker : checkGWTExistence(06_TESTS/)
Note over HardConstraintChecker : ✓ 目录下有.feature文件?\n✓ (feature文件存在性属硬约束\nPRD-GWT对应关系属软约束\n→ 由SoftConstraintEvaluator评估)

alt 快消型
  Note over HardConstraintChecker : 快消型硬约束仅检查核心项:\nPRD必填项 ✓\nGWT文件存在 ✓\nPlantUML/Sprint Plan/API Spec不检查
else 长期迭代型
  HardConstraintChecker -> HardConstraintChecker : checkPlantUMLSyntax(03_ARCHITECTURE/*.puml)
  Note over HardConstraintChecker : ✓ @startuml/@enduml配对?\n✓ 语法可解析?

  HardConstraintChecker -> HardConstraintChecker : checkAPIEndpoints(04_API_SPEC/api-spec.md)
  Note over HardConstraintChecker : ✓ 每个端点有Method+Path+Schema?

  HardConstraintChecker -> HardConstraintChecker : checkSprintGranularity(05_PROJECT_PLAN/sprint-plan.md)
  Note over HardConstraintChecker : ✓ Sprint粒度<=2周?

  HardConstraintChecker -> HardConstraintChecker : checkTeamConfig(05_PROJECT_PLAN/team-config.md)
  Note over HardConstraintChecker : ✓ 列出激活角色+职责+交付物?
end

deactivate ProjectDocumentSystem

HardConstraintChecker --> JudgeAgent : HardCheckReport{通过/退回+缺失清单}
deactivate HardConstraintChecker

alt 硬约束不通过
  JudgeAgent -> JudgeAgent : verdict("退回")
  JudgeAgent --> ProjectDocumentSystem : 退回 + 缺失项清单
  activate ProjectDocumentSystem
  ProjectDocumentSystem --> GuideAgent : 退回通知
  deactivate ProjectDocumentSystem
  activate GuideAgent

  alt 快消型 && 退回次数 < 2
    Note over GuideAgent : 修复缺失项 → 重新提交
  else 快消型 && 退回次数 >= 2
    Note over GuideAgent : 通知用户人工介入
  else 长期迭代型(不限次数)
    Note over GuideAgent : 修复缺失项 → 重新提交
  end
  deactivate GuideAgent

  deactivate JudgeAgent
  detach

else 硬约束通过
  JudgeAgent -> SoftConstraintEvaluator : executeSoftEval(project-root)
  activate SoftConstraintEvaluator

  Note over SoftConstraintEvaluator : 软约束AI评估\n(快消型: 仅PRD-GWT对应+可读性\n长期型: 全维度)

  SoftConstraintEvaluator -> SoftConstraintEvaluator : evaluateLogicConsistency(prd, arch)
  Note over SoftConstraintEvaluator : PRD功能 → 架构模块 是否对齐?

  alt 快消型
    SoftConstraintEvaluator -> SoftConstraintEvaluator : evaluateTestability(prd, features)
    Note over SoftConstraintEvaluator : 快消型核心: 每个F-xx有GWT Scenario?\n覆盖正常+异常路径?

    SoftConstraintEvaluator -> SoftConstraintEvaluator : evaluateReadability(docs)
    Note over SoftConstraintEvaluator : 零基础用户能否大致理解?
  else 长期迭代型
    SoftConstraintEvaluator -> SoftConstraintEvaluator : evaluateTestability(prd, features)
    Note over SoftConstraintEvaluator : 每个F-xx有GWT Scenario?\n覆盖正常+异常路径?

    SoftConstraintEvaluator -> SoftConstraintEvaluator : evaluateCompleteness(docs)
    Note over SoftConstraintEvaluator : 异常场景/边界条件是否被覆盖?

    SoftConstraintEvaluator -> SoftConstraintEvaluator : evaluateReadability(docs)
    Note over SoftConstraintEvaluator : 零基础用户能否大致理解?(无未解释技术术语)
  end

  SoftConstraintEvaluator --> JudgeAgent : SoftEvalReport{通过/建议改进/退回}
  deactivate SoftConstraintEvaluator

  alt 软约束通过
    JudgeAgent -> JudgeAgent : verdict("通过")
    JudgeAgent --> ProjectDocumentSystem : 审查通过
    activate ProjectDocumentSystem
    ProjectDocumentSystem --> GuideAgent : 通过通知
    deactivate ProjectDocumentSystem
    Note over JudgeAgent : 通知编程Agent可开工

  else 软约束不通过
    JudgeAgent -> JudgeAgent : verdict("退回")
    JudgeAgent --> ProjectDocumentSystem : 退回 + 具体矛盾点 + 改进建议
    activate ProjectDocumentSystem
    ProjectDocumentSystem --> GuideAgent : 退回通知
    deactivate ProjectDocumentSystem
    activate GuideAgent
    Note over GuideAgent : 修复矛盾 → 重新提交硬+软约束
    deactivate GuideAgent
  end
end

deactivate JudgeAgent

== 第二道关: 代码审查(编程Agent提交后) ==

CodingAgent -> JudgeAgent : 提交代码(project-root + 测试报告)
activate JudgeAgent

JudgeAgent -> HardConstraintChecker : checkCodeClassMatches(code, 03_ARCHITECTURE/*.puml)
activate HardConstraintChecker

Note over HardConstraintChecker : 代码结构 vs PlantUML逐项对比

HardConstraintChecker -> HardConstraintChecker : 提取代码中所有自定义类定义
Note over HardConstraintChecker : 判定规则:\n- 不需要import/require → 语言内置类型(跳过)\n- 需要import或外部包提供 → 自定义类(必须匹配)

loop PlantUML中每个类
  HardConstraintChecker -> HardConstraintChecker : 检查: 代码中是否存在同名类?
  alt 存在
    HardConstraintChecker -> HardConstraintChecker : 检查: 属性名+类型是否一致?
    HardConstraintChecker -> HardConstraintChecker : 检查: 方法签名是否一致?
  else 不存在
    Note over HardConstraintChecker : → "规约要求但未实现"
  end
end

loop 代码中每个自定义类
  HardConstraintChecker -> HardConstraintChecker : 检查: PlantUML中是否已定义?
  alt 未定义
    Note over HardConstraintChecker : → "未在规约中定义"
  end
end

HardConstraintChecker --> JudgeAgent : PlantUML一致性报告
deactivate HardConstraintChecker

JudgeAgent -> HardConstraintChecker : checkGWTExistence → 测试报告{passed==total?}
activate HardConstraintChecker
HardConstraintChecker --> JudgeAgent : 测试全量通过 ✓/✗
deactivate HardConstraintChecker

alt 全部通过
  JudgeAgent -> JudgeAgent : verdict("通过")
  JudgeAgent --> CodingAgent : 代码审查通过 ✓ → 可交付

else 未通过
  JudgeAgent -> JudgeAgent : verdict("退回")
  JudgeAgent --> CodingAgent : 退回 + 不一致清单(GWT失败+PlantUML不匹配)
  activate CodingAgent
  Note over CodingAgent : 修复代码 → 重新提交
  deactivate CodingAgent
end

deactivate JudgeAgent

@enduml
